<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) & Erlich et al. (2016) mollusc shell marginal buckling and antimarginal rib morphogenesis — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Minimizes the exact fourth-order nonlinear Winkler-beam energy functional via L-BFGS-B (`relax_winkler_mantle_margin`, L198-297), implements the analytical critical buckling load P_c = 2*sqrt(E*I*k), intrinsic wavelength lambda_c = 2*pi*(E*I/k)^(1/4), and supercritical pitchfork amplitude A_eq(P) = sqrt(4*q_c^2*(P-P_c)/(3*kappa_3)) (L136-174), synthesizes 3D accretionary shell valves across isometric vs intercalating growth (`simulate_accretionary_shell_3d`, L303-398), and verifies the subcritical negative control (P/P_c=0.65 -> 0 ribs). Backed by 4 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_072_mollusc_shell_marginal_buckling.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-chirat-mollusc-shell-marginal-buckling-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Chirat, Moulton & Goriely (2013) & Erlich et al. (2016) mollusc shell marginal buckling and antimarginal rib morphogenesis — Morphometric validation: 92/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Extracts 9 reference-anchored morphometrics in `measure_morphoeval()` (L1118-1210), including 12-species wavelength scaling correlation (`r = 1.0000`, `RMSE = 0.125 mm`), 12-species rib-count correlation (`r = 1.0000`), log-log quarter-power exponent (`alpha = 0.2500 ± 0.0005` vs theoretical `0.25`), sub-bin spectral wavelength accuracy (`8.7764 mm` vs `8.7766 mm`), pitchfork amplitude correlation (`r = 0.9999`), subcritical negative control (`0.0 ribs`), and specimen costae count (`14` vs `14`) and angular spacing CV (`0.2196`)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
